        "node_id": "n_14_dedd70",
        "thought_text": "Analyze the initial configuration of the cards. If the sequence of cards can be divided into segments of length k such that each segment can be flipped to match the adjacent segment, then the game might end in a draw. Otherwise, Tokitsukaze might have an advantage.",
